A. Commit message:
Backport Xen hypercall changes for improved stability and security

B. Change summary:
This patch backports changes to the Xen hypercall interface, ensuring better stability and security in the older version of the kernel. The changes include updating the hypercall mechanism to use static calls, removing deprecated code, and adding necessary headers for compatibility.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium: Code diff will be applied and a pull request will be sent to the developer to merge, but there are no indirect changes expected to be done in other parts of the system.

D. Fixed Code:
```diff
